'''Friends' Anniversary''' (Japanese: '''ともだち記念日''' ''Tomodachi Kinenbi'') is the seventh ending song of the Japanese [[Pikachu short]]s.

It debuted in ''[[PK07|Pikachu and Pichu]]''.

